## a uuid only when it is blank, so dropping a client's here is what makes the server issue it. The
## predicate is the one that builds preservedOnUpdate in Repository.java.template: keep the two in
## step. The drop lives on the
## REST surface and never in the repository, because save() is the create path of every system
## writer - the attachment upload, the snapshot mint, a create-from, a posting - and those assign
## exactly these columns by design (#7620).
#set($systemOwnedOnCreate = [])
#set($reportedOnCreate = [])
#set($generatedKey = false)
#foreach($property in $properties)
#if($property.dataPrimaryKey && $property.dataAutoIncrement)
#set($generatedKey = $property)
