## SAME row, or a LITERAL (#7338: the positive quantity, the percentage at most 100, the date that is
## not in the past). A comparison is about values that EXIST, so an absent left operand is not a
## violation - requiredness is its own declaration. Numbers compare by value through BigDecimal (a
## decimal against a long still compares exactly); temporals compare through their own compareTo,
## which is why the parser holds the two sides to one family - and why a moment literal is rendered
