## document number and a uuid on insert, so demanding them here would refuse every create of a numbered
## document with a message about a field no form has (#7099). A relation defaulting from a flag
## (`init: { flag: }`, #8683) is filled there too; with no holder the repository refuses it by name.
#set($requiredChecked = $property.isRequiredProperty && !$property.dataDefaultValue && !$property.relationshipInitFlag && !$property.numberStampOnCreate && !$property.generatedUuid)
